## GHI CHU VE PHAM VI AP DUNG (SCOPE NOTE)

Giay phep MIT o tren chi ap dung cho phan ma nguon do nhom tu phat trien trong
repository nay, bao gom nhung khong gioi han:

- Pipeline tien xu ly du lieu bang Apache Spark (notebooks/01_spark_pipeline).
- Mo hinh cai tien TA-ACRF-RNN va co che time-aware relation
  (notebooks/03_ta_acrf_rnn, database liên quan).
- Tang du lieu phan tan PostgreSQL va NebulaGraph, bao gom app_node,
  schema, script import va truy van (database/app, database/nebula,
  database/sql, database/scripts).

Repository nay KHONG cap phep lai va KHONG chiu trach nhiem ve:

- Kien truc va bat ky doan ma nao duoc sao chep truc tiep tu repository
  goc cua bai bao nen "Attention-based Conditional Random Field for
  Financial Fraud Detection" (IJCAI 2025), tai:
  https://github.com/XNetLab/ACRF-RNN
  Phan nay (neu con giu lai, vi du trong notebooks/02_acrf_rnn_baseline
  de doi chieu ket qua) tuan theo dieu khoan cap phep cua repository goc;
  vui long tham khao truc tiep LICENSE cua XNetLab/ACRF-RNN truoc khi
  su dung lai.
- Bo du lieu tai chinh cong ty-nam (raw/processed) khong duoc dinh kem
  trong repository nay.

Neu ban su dung lai ma nguon trong repository nay cho muc dich nghien cuu
hoac hoc tap, vui long trich dan ca repository nay (xem CITATION.cff) va
bai bao nen ACRF-RNN (IJCAI 2025).
